--- handlers
add first 1
add second 1
ctrl+c: generate 1, handled, ran: second(0)
ctrl+break: generate 1, handled, ran: second(1)
second passes it on: generate 1, handled, ran: second(0) first(0)
remove first 1
remove first again 0 (error 87)
second alone: generate 1, handled, ran: second(0)
generate to a bad group 0 (error 11)
generate a bad event 0 (error 87)
--- ignoring ctrl+c
ignore 1
ctrl+c ignored: generate 1, nothing handled it, ran:
ctrl+break still: generate 1, handled, ran: second(1)
stop ignoring 1
ctrl+c again: generate 1, handled, ran: second(0)
